## ESA WorldCover 2021 v200 — CC BY 4.0
© ESA WorldCover project 2021 / Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2021) processed by ESA WorldCover
consortium. Licensed under CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
Used for the scenic index's land-cover terms — canopy, impervious, water and open land, as fractions of a 150 m
buffer around each way. Those per-way fractions are a modified work and carry this attribution with them.
This layer replaced the USFS Tree Canopy Cover and MRLC NLCD fractional impervious surface the plan named:
MRLC's S3 bucket refuses all anonymous access (HTTP 403, Requester Pays) and their landing pages carry no
download link, so there is no unauthenticated retrieval path. Nothing in this tree is derived from USFS or MRLC
data, and neither is listed below any more.

## United States government data — public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105)
